144
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:51,520
♪With new ones♪

145
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,640
Su Tang's statement
and Su Shi's diary show

146
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:05,600
their relationship
was fraught with conflict.

147
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,680
Su Shi developed

148
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,440
a pathological protective mechanism
because of past trauma.

149
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:14,120
She seemed to treat men as tools,

150
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,640
claiming to be the one in control.

151
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,320
But deep down,

152
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,160
she was terrified and disgusted

153
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,440
by that kind of dependency.

154
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,120
So she projected her fear

155
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,800
onto her daughter

156
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:26,160
and severely suppressed her femininity.

157
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,600
Like long hair, dresses,

158
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,960
and dating boys.

159
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:32,320
She was afraid
Su Tang would repeat the same mistakes.

160
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,600
Her control and abuse

161
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:38,440
were actually an extreme form
of protection.

162
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,760
Su Tang chose to be with Zhang Xiaodong.

163
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,000
It was both imitation and revenge.

164
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,920
This Executer understood
the psychological weaknesses

165
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,400
of this mother and daughter
earlier than we did.

166
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,960
He didn't do it himself.

167
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,360
Instead, he precisely delivered

168
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:51,600
the fuse to Su Tang
through the internet.

169
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,960
He used her hatred for Su Shi

170
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,520
to deepen her self-denial.

171
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,600
Step by step, he led her to see

172
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,160
her mother as the source
of contamination.

173
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:02,400
What terrifying
psychological manipulation.

174
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,000
This person

175
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,080
directed the whole tragedy.

176
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,920
Su Shi and Su Tang

177
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:09,920
were both victims

178
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:10,720
and perpetrators.

179
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,440
Su Tang could've called the police

180
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,560
and asked for our help,

181
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,600
but she chose the most extreme way.

182
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:16,560
So

183
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,160
we have to root out

184
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,640
whoever was behind this, pushing

185
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,760
and manipulating her.

186
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,240
He could drive a wedge

187
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,600
between them so precisely.

188
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,960
He must've been close to them
in daily life

189
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,640
to know them that well.

190
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:29,480
Whoever made Su Shi build

191
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,960
that canary survival rule

192
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,160
must be a predator

193
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,720
she couldn't fight back against.

194
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:39,520
Zhang Xiaodong,

195
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,680
Su Shi's ex-boyfriend and boss.

196
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,160
He got Su Tang hooked on drugs

197
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,480
and destroyed her relationship
with her mother.

198
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,160
Mr. Zhang, this way.

199
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,000
Thanks.

200
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,160
Have a seat here.

201
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,200
Sorry about that.

202
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,880
(Police Spirit and Valor)
Sorry.

203
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,280
I just got off the plane.

204
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,680
And with this Su Shi thing,

205
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,880
I'm in a daze.

206
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,280
I know she had an accident.

207
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,760
I'm pretty broken up about it.

208
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:15,360
I promoted her myself.

209
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,720
What a shame.

210
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,720
Where were you on the 29th
of last month?

211
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,000
The 29th?

212
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,800
Qixi Festival?

213
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,120
If it was Qixi,

214
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,720
I should've been out of town

215
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,360
with my girlfriend.

216
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,360
My wife passed away young.

217
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,200
I never remarried after that.

218
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:35,120
Legally speaking,

219
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,520
I'm single now.

220
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,560
From what we understand,

221
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,760
you and Ms. Su Shi had more than

222
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,320
just a work relationship.

223
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,600
There was a romance.

224
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,720
Yes.

225
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,920
But that was years ago.

226
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,240
We split up later

227
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,160
because we weren't compatible.

228
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,360
We were colleagues to begin with.

229
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,920
After we broke up, we stayed friends.

230
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,760
Over the years,

231
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,320
I did help her out financially

232
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,160
here and there.

233
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:03,520
But that's all.

234
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,320
We also learned

235
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,680
that you and Su Tang

236
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,200
had a rather unusual relationship.

237
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,280
Officer,

238
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,640
Su Tang is a long-term drug addict

239
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,520
with unstable mental health.

240
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,400
How much of what comes out of her mouth

241
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,160
is true?

242
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:21,520
How much is hallucination
from the drugs?

243
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,720
You two are the professionals.

244
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:25,480
I'm sure you can tell

245
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,120
better than I can.

246
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,120
I think

247
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,720
there's no need

248
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,160
to waste time on this

249
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:33,800
and let the real killer walk free,

250
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:34,880
