251
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:38,960
(Police Spirit and Valor)
Mr. Zhang.

252
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,080
Hello, Mr. Dong.

253
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:42,160
I'm Zhang Xiaodong's personal lawyer,

254
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,240
Wang Wei.

255
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,720
For the rest of this questioning,

256
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,720
I need to be present with my client
the whole time.

257
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,440
Mr. Zhang will cooperate
with the police.

258
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,440
But he also needs
to protect his legal rights.

259
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,280
Come on.

260
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,080
Wang.

261
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:53,640
(Police Spirit and Valor)

262
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:54,440
Sorry.

263
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,880
Wang

264
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,040
is extremely cautious.

265
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:59,080
Lawyers, you know. Occupational habit.

266
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,320
Understandable.

267
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:01,520
Don't mind him.

268
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:02,640
Let's continue.

269
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,280
Okay. Let's continue.

270
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:07,920
From what you know,

271
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,720
