about her personal life.

275
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,400
She's an ex-girlfriend, after all.

276
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,880
Mr. Zhang, watch the time.

277
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:30,480
Um, I'm really sorry.

278
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,120
I almost forgot.

279
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,280
I have

280
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,640
