281
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,880
Lots of friends from the business world
will be there.

282
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,320
I'm the host.

283
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,000
It wouldn't be right if I didn't show.

284
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:42,600
How about we do this another day?

285
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:46,960
Let me just say this.

286
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:49,160
If it's to help the investigation,

287
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:52,240
and of course for Su Shi,

288
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:56,160
I'll cooperate around the clock.

289
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,560
If you need to ask anything else later,

290
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:00,600
please contact me first.

291
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:01,800
Here's my business card.

292
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:04,960
Whatever works.

293
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,240
Contacting Wang is fine too.

294
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:19,800
Do I need to sign something?

295
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,120
Sign here.

296
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,200
(Police Spirit and Valor)
Thanks.

297
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,400
Take a look.

298
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,400
No problem, Mr. Zhang.

299
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:42,120
Sorry,

300
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,600
I'll be going now.

301
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:57,120
(Wang Wei, Partner/Lawyer)

302
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,240
What a hypocrite.

303
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,960
Seems polite.

304
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:02,040
Didn't give us a single useful lead.

305
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:04,480
Where's Qin Ming?

306
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:07,120
Go over the autopsy report again.

307
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,600
No way we can't catch them slipping.

308
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,240
Tell me the truth.

309
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:40,560
Su Shi's death has nothing
to do with you, right?

310
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,520
Mr. Zhang,

311
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,200
I swear,

312
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,960
I really had nothing to do with her...

313
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:45,720
Hold on.

314
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:59,160
If you're late again,

315
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:00,960
don't bother coming.

316
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,520
Mr. Zhang, I won't be late.

317
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,280
Mr. Zhang.

318
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,920
What were you about to say?

319
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,400
I was gonna say...

320
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,800
I heard rumors going around

321
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:15,800
that her daughter did it.

322
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,160
Don't you dare lie to me.

323
00:17:58,360 --> 00:17:59,480
(Audio 603kHz)
(Dear listeners,)

324
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,440
(what position are you in right now,)

325
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,960
(listening to our radio station?)

326
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,600
(Curled up on the couch?)

327
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:07,000
(Or watching the flowing lights
outside the car?)

328
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,840
(Remember to turn your mood)

329
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:10,440
(into tonight's stars in the comments.)

330
00:18:18,330 --> 00:18:22,560
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

331
00:18:23,090 --> 00:18:27,430
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

332
00:18:27,430 --> 00:18:31,430
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

333
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:35,780
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

334
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:48,670
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

335
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:51,650
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

336
00:18:52,170 --> 00:18:55,790
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

337
00:18:55,790 --> 00:19:00,020
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

338
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:04,740
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

339
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:08,890
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

340
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:13,540
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

341
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:17,630
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

342
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:30,800
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

343
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:35,140
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

344
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:38,910
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

345
00:19:38,910 --> 00:19:41,810
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

346
00:19:41,810 --> 00:19:46,600
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

347
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:51,250
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

348
00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:53,510
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

349
00:19:53,510 --> 00:19:55,650
♪We stop here in this night♪

350
00:19:55,650 --> 00:20:00,070
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

351
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:06,050
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

352
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:14,810
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

353
00:20:26,330 --> 00:20:33,260
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

354
